<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.157 µm on the D. yakuba abdominal cuticle (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each Lean theorem names the inequality it proves (trace, cross term, discriminant, ablation, chronoseries ratio). The Python dispersion, sweep, ablation, and radial estimator cite those same quantities. The docstring separates the QTL papers from the PDE." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.157 µm on the D. yakuba abdominal cuticle (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Unchanged Schnakenberg core: trace −0.2, determinant 1, cross term 15, discriminant positive, equal diffusion stable. Linearised PDE versus the discrete dispersion gives r = 0.99525 and RMSE 0.0394 over 22 modes. The pass-2 wavelength estimator does not alter the PDE." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.157 µm on the D. yakuba abdominal cuticle (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pearson r = 0.995 and RMSE = 0.039 on the dispersion. FFT wavelength 1.993e-06 m versus λ* 2.157e-06 m (not equal). Radial-period KS = 0.328 versus an ideal of 0; pass-1 bead KS was 0.592. Specimen dark-band fraction 0.121 versus a neutral prior of 0.5. Ablation σ* = −0.102 versus the marginal value 0. The residual KS is the periodic boundary distorting rays that hit the edge." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-pearson-r-linearised-pde-vs-discrete>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-sigma-max>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-growth-animation-frame-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ks-distance-of-radial-arm-spacings-vs-gaussian>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-nonlinear-stripe-radial-fft-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-rendered-frame-min-side>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-dark-band-area-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-dominant-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-stripe-radial-fft-peak-bin>,
