<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-yakuba-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.157 µm on the D. yakuba abdominal cuticle (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Last-frame CV similarity against the vendored specimen is 86.8 (12-bin orientation, 24-bin radial FFT, structure-tensor coherency, occupancy; 640×480, 12 frames, frame difference 0.20). Both images are tan spirals. The specimen's radial peak bin is 5 and the GIF's is 7; those are not copied onto each other. Score stays below 90 because the specimen is the gallery asset, with a caption bar the simulation does not copy." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
